{"story":{"id":"event-country-53","title":{"zh":"外星生物收集","en":"Alien Organism Procurement"},"category":"stories","kind":"event","image":"art/8d5475edf8f6f84b714c.webp","start":"country.53","chapters":17,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"[Root.Capital.GetName]上外星生物博物馆馆长提出采购某些活体外星样本的请求。这些生物一般出现在已调查过的宜居世界中，但捕获难度很大。这需要科研船动用全部资源并花费大量时间才能做到。","en":"The director of the Museum of Exobiology on [Root.Capital.GetName] has issued a request for the procurement of several live alien specimens. These creatures were spotted on surveyed habitable worlds, but they are difficult to capture. It will require the full "},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"country.53","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"随时间随机发生","en":"Happens randomly over time"}]},"children":["n2","n3","n4","n5","n6","n7","n8","n9","n10"]},"n2":{"doc":"event_chains:specimen_procurement_chain","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"country.53.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_1.txt:1660"},"children":[]},"n3":{"doc":"special_projects:TARBLAC_PROCUREMENT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"country.53.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_1.txt:1687"},"children":["n11"]},"n4":{"doc":"special_projects:TASSARGOID_PROCUREMENT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"country.53.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_1.txt:1714"},"children":["n12"]},"n5":{"doc":"special_projects:ORINTHI_PROCUREMENT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"country.53.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_1.txt:1741"},"children":["n13"]},"n6":{"doc":"special_projects:SNIRAN_PROCUREMENT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"country.53.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_1.txt:1768"},"children":["n14"]},"n7":{"doc":"special_projects:GOOLANTHA_PROCUREMENT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"country.53.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_1.txt:1795"},"ch